### Explicit pagination
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/software-engineer?page=0&size=2

### Next page
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/software-engineer?page=1&size=2

###sort by id ascending
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/software-engineer?page=0&size=5&sort=id,asc


### sort by id descending
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/software-engineer?page=0&size=5&sort=id,desc

###multiple sorts
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/software-engineer?page=0&size=5&sort=techStack,asc&sort=id,asc

###filtering,sorting,pagination tests Filtering works independently
#
#Filtering + pagination works together
#
#Sorting still works
#
#Pagination metadata unchanged

GET http://localhost:8080//api/v1/software-engineer

###
GET http://localhost:8080//api/v1/software-engineer?name=an
###
GET http://localhost:8080//api/v1/software-engineer?techStack=java
###
GET http://localhost:8080//api/v1/software-engineer?name=an&techStack=java
###
GET http://localhost:8080//api/v1/software-engineer?page=1&size=3
###
GET http://localhost:8080//api/v1/software-engineer?sort=id,desc


### For Security test requests

### Register User
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "pranshu",
  "password": "1234",
  "role": "ROLE_USER"
}



### Login Request
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "pranshu",
  "password": "1234"
}





